Package: gitweft
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: sorrelfox <sorrelfox@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: vcs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sorrelfox/gitweft
Description: fast, offline Git client
 Gitweft is a native Git client with a visual commit graph, staging by file,
 hunk or line, a merge conflict tool, branches, remotes, tags and stashes, and
 undo for local operations.
 .
 It has no accounts, no cloud features and no telemetry, and works without an
 internet connection: the only network traffic comes from git itself, talking
 to your remotes.
